  "extractionNotes": "Refusal decision (art. 29 ust. 1 pkt 1 UZ): no right to maternity benefit 2025-06-12..2026-06-10 because, by a separate ZUS decision, the claimant was not compulsorily insured as the payer's employee from 2024-10-04; the child was born 2025-06-12. Internal verification request (study date 2025-06-12; reply dated 2025-10-28): employment at 1/10 of full time with a fixed salary disproportionate to the fraction; incapacity from 2024-10-28 (24 days after hiring) to 2025-05-11, certified with the pregnancy code from 2024-11-14; the payer filed no sickness claims; the contribution base was also found incorrect. The refusal decision is undated in the scan; asOf = date of the verification reply. The salary amount is not legible and is omitted. The claim covered 52 weeks; the maternity/parental split is the claim, and the 81.5% option is inferred from the joint request. Variant: with the non-coverage decision removed the title stands and the claim is granted."
